From 818c11ec0b94caf7c2ce47d93a0baae9f9f569c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Apr 2026 19:05:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] feat(feishu): outbound message hooks, media/image
 sending, and channel integration

- Support media/image sending in outbound messages
- Emit message_sent hooks from dispatcher and add group plugin dispatch mode
- Emit per-media message_sent events and suppress discarded card emissions
- Restore outbound hook parity and media metadata
- Enforce feishu card rendering for outbound sends
- Persist bot media-only messages to DB
- Prevent false media-only persistence when streamed text is pending
- Register reply dispatcher and expose exports

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
